{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1654.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"84ec5d6a0599c91353965fbb6201f9622ac2eb9232f40ac984d91c902a751c61","ja":"贈りものはなにがいい？","zh":"送什么礼物好？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1654.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"efa7558092153a60308d048202b88aa20cfd4e9a48ac8ceb1dd40b1105b77c9f","ja":"先日の北海道旅行、とても楽しくて\n充実した時間を過ごさせていただきましたね。","zh":"前几天的北海道之旅非常开心，\n让我度过了一段充实美好的时光呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1654.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1946ec03a2198d18215fc51c337396ea8c19fad65add5c2cb646a5cd0f5e970d","ja":"ひなばあちゃんのお家、最高でしたよね～！\nおいしいごはん～♪　ふわふわのお布団～♪","zh":"日向奶奶家真的太棒了～！\n美味的饭菜～♪　软绵绵的被窝～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1654.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8642814caab1806afc079d170a16e9773e33c2bde0d50c304998e1b7916db148","ja":"ええ、とても。なので、感謝の気持ちをお伝えする\nために、何かお礼をお贈りしたいのですが……。","zh":"是的，非常喜欢。所以为了向大家传达感激的心情，\n我想送点礼物表达谢意，可是……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1654.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"357fd957c47c40c0b1e65c2ee57af9d8605592ae7864bb47146dc6793daae646","ja":"あっ、私もお礼、したいです！\nひなばあちゃん達、何を贈ったら喜んでくれるかな～？","zh":"啊，我也想表达谢意！\n给日向奶奶她们送什么，她们才会高兴呢～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1654.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"49e7fb553543a7a0cf347e32c4f83d88d7c27d9356d5c7f6999e61fc4462e9ef","ja":"そうですね……皆さんのおかげで、北海道の魅力を\nより感じることができたわけですし……。","zh":"也是呢……多亏了大家，才能\n更加深切地感受到北海道的魅力……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1654.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"b75f3475303e7e98f7a64b1fa2f6d43be090501f128d57e1336de94773b878bb","ja":"……あ。では今度は、私たちの地元の良さを\n贈り物でお伝えしてみるのは、いかがでしょう？","zh":"……啊。那下次通过赠送礼物，向大家展现\n我们家乡的魅力，您觉得怎么样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1654.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"38eaa9b0af5f8ad54dd61ba5dc2898acdb283ea681c9dce9124bd12748677ada","ja":"わぁ～！　それ、すっごくいいですね！\n私も横浜のおいしいもの、知ってもらいたいです！","zh":"哇～！那个主意太棒了！\n我也想让大家了解横滨的美食！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1654.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"19c05c8ba45523f735578fa7581b87f913ba80434d8762ec6a1a414846731225","ja":"ふわふわ生地のカステラとか、さくさくミルフィーユ\nとか、おいしいものがいっぱいあるんですよ♪","zh":"松软蛋糕胚的长崎蛋糕啦、酥脆的千层酥\n之类的，有好多美味呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1654.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"17b341cd723b9dbc3b24621f18acfdc461b300a4003a99099b77da51af35d1db","ja":"金沢ですと、きんつばや最中などが\n思いつきますが……。","zh":"要是金泽的话，倒是能想到\n金锷饼和最中之类的糕点……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1654.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"87d7737e01c78f827f206848d1b8ced92b2c4350df6e73c7d468e2c561376aec","ja":"あ、日持ちするものでないと、いけませんね。\nそれでしたら……。","zh":"啊，得是能放得住的东西才行呢。\n那样的话……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1654.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"b6d727e01c5bf801d22259a9e2e84c4c82f4578bf6498c40dcc459bded47acc4","ja":"えへへ、地元のいいものって、\nいっぱい思いつけちゃいますよね～♪","zh":"嘿嘿，关于家乡的好东西，\n总能想到好多好多呢～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
